{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*^-^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはんは、かぼちゃのスープとホットケーキでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホットケーキは厚い生地のが好きです。\nふわふわに焼けるホットケーキの研究でもしようかな(´-`).｡oO♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京には、パンケーキがいたるところで売っていて、いつも迷ってしまいます。\n今は、全粒粉のパンケーキが気になっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味はベリー系が好きです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのセーラー服!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH54NQCNFKVRJ28M0Z6PWSS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装、1番好きかもしれない!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラ服はほとんど着たことが無かったので着れて嬉しい(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪を巻いたりストレートにしたりヘアアレンジをしたり、髪の毛はまだ迷走しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな髪型日好きですか?握手会で教えて下さい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会来てね(♡˙︶˙♡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH54PPQ7PQJNJ8WPY96PYA3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浮気は嫌です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH54QPAS58ESJS55VYEWEAP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}